# E2 Tests for DyPOS

## Offline Mode Tests
- Test that POS works without backend connection
- Test item browsing from cache
- Test customer selection from cache
- Test invoice creation and queuing when offline
- Test auto-sync when back online

## Core Flow Tests
- Test complete sales cycle (items -> customer -> payment -> receipt)
- Test promotional offers application
- Test split payments
- Test shift management (open/close)
- Test draft invoice save and resume

## Performance Tests
- Test cache loading times
- Test search response times
- Test UI interaction responsiveness